      "fiscal_period": "FY2024",
      "note_number": "2",
      "note_title": "Note 2 - Government Grants and Collaborative Research",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks_in_note": 1,
      "text": "[BioHealth Diagnostics Inc. | FY2024 | Note 2 - Government Grants and Collaborative Research]\n\nNote 2 - Government Grants and Collaborative Research\nDuring FY2024, the entity received GBP 2.4 million in government grants for oncology diagnostic development. Grants related to income are\nrecognized in the statement of profit and loss as a reduction of research and development expense in the period in which the associated research\ncosts are incurred.",
