      "chunk_index": 0,
      "total_chunks_in_note": 1,
      "text": "[BioHealth Diagnostics Inc. | FY2024 | Note 3 - Contingent Liabilities and IP Licensing]\n\nNote 3 - Contingent Liabilities and IP Licensing\nThe company is engaged in cross-licensing agreements with two academic research institutions. Contingent royalty obligations range between 2.5%\nand 4.0% of net commercial kit revenues. There are no ongoing patent infringement disputes or litigation claims.",
